TODOs — ALL RESOLVED (2026-07-17)

Root cause of "Couldn't load this object" (default tee/hoodie): the exported GLB was
valid glTF (Khronos validator: 0 errors), so never malformed — it tripped TWO Scene
Viewer import guardrails, both fixed:
  1. Prints were three DecalGeometry -> non-indexed ~6000-vertex projected primitives
     that Filament rejects. Now clean INDEXED curved-plane decals.
  2. front+back+2 sleeve prints = 3-4 transparent (BLEND) materials; Scene Viewer
     caps alpha materials at 2. Prints switched to alpha-cutout (MASK) -> 0 blend.
  + separate ~40x oversize: geometry authored in inches but glTF/USDZ are METRES ->
    one uniform x0.0254 scale (fixes GLB and USDZ; USDZExporter hardcodes
    metersPerUnit=1, so no extra x100).

