  [x] Default vs custom — unified: all products use the same avatar pipeline now.
  [x] Avatar wearing the garment — a realistic, life-size (~1.73 m) neutral matte-gray
      display mannequin (AI-generated) wears the tee/hoodie with the print on the chest.
  [x] Avatar scale — inches->metres; no longer ~40x oversize.
  [x] Avatar quality — replaced the crude capsule/sphere mannequin with a clean,
